.3.17","description":null,"creator":null,"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":19,"state":"closed","created_at":"2013-10-11T20:41:41Z","updated_at":"2014-04-29T00:38:58Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2014-04-29T00:38:58Z"},"comments":12,"created_at":"2013-10-11T20:47:33Z","updated_at":"2013-10-14T19:20:54Z","closed_at":"2013-10-14T19:20:54Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Created by **mwolf**, 19th Nov 2010. _(originally [Lighthouse ticket #1300](http://cakephp.lighthouseapp.com/projects/42648/tickets/1300))_:\n\n---\n\nIn postgresql a \"SELECT field1, field2 FROM tools ORDER BY manufacturer LIMIT 20 OFFSET 40\" returns some entries which are also returned by \"SELECT field1, field2 FROM tools ORDER BY manufacturer LIMIT 20 OFFSET 80\"\n\nTo let the users order by a column which has a lot of same entries (PaginatorHelper::sort) the query should be something like \"SELECT field1, field2 FROM tools ORDER BY manufacturer, id LIMIT 20 OFFSET 40\"\n","closed_by":{"login":"lorenzo","id":37621,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37621?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo","html_url":"https://github.com/lorenzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/user